[3.021, "o", "\r\n▶ Step 5: LLM Agent Loop (natural language → ESP32)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────\r\n"]
[1.010, "o", "$ curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3333/relay \\\r\n    -d '{\"command\":\"What is the temperature of the ESP32?\"}'\r\n"]
[6.201, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Agent steps:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "    ┌─ tool: read_sensor\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    │ sensor: temp\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    └─ result: {\"celsius\":38.1,\"raw_api\":true}\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  LLM response:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    **Current ESP32-C3 Temperature: 38.1°C**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    **Is it normal?** ✅ **Yes, this is normal.**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    For an ESP32-C3 microcontroller:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    - **Typical operating range:** 0°C to 80°C\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    - **Normal ambient/idle temperature:** 25–45°C\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    - **Your reading (38.1°C):** Comfortably within safe limits\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    At 38.1°C, the chip is running warm but healthy. This is typical for:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    - Room temperature (~25°C) + internal dissipation from CPU\r\n"]
[3.008, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  Demo complete. 16/16 integration tests also pass.\r\n"]
